## Windows codecs

AVIF, HEIC/HEIF and camera RAW files are decoded by codecs that are part of
Windows or free Microsoft Store extensions ("AV1 Video Extension", "HEIF Image
Extensions", "Raw Image Extension"). They are not distributed with img-converter.

